      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The instance was a Group+. Were you in that group?\n\nIf you like opened the instance page from external websites, then it willl show the instance, but if you attempt to join it without being in the group, then it will give you a 403.\n\nBut yeah likelly it is just the queue being an issue here yes\n\nOh and once you got a 403 in that way, then after you joined the group, you must restart vrchat, else it will not even attempt/look if you have permissions to join it anymore. vrchat just straight up uses cache and doesnt update that.\n\nBut that is probably a whole different bug report on itself tho...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
